c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/78563ccf8cded4c63a2c9ba55768641069e9de49/ss_78563ccf8cded4c63a2c9ba55768641069e9de49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748703546","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/78563ccf8cded4c63a2c9ba55768641069e9de49/ss_78563ccf8cded4c63a2c9ba55768641069e9de49.600x338.jpg?t=1748703546"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/be7eccf6d0628ba042684d4e659f60aaac0d44d9/ss_be7eccf6d0628ba042684d4e659f60aaac0d44d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748703546","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/be7eccf6d0628ba042684d4e659f60aaac0d44d9/ss_be7eccf6d0628ba042684d4e659f60aaac0d44d9.600x338.jpg?t=1748703546"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/3b6c47e43c9f96ce00a408dc2a42939ec9df0f6e/ss_3b6c47e43c9f96ce00a408dc2a42939ec9df0f6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748703546","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367420/3b6c47e43c9f96ce00a408dc2a42939ec9df0f6e/ss_3b6c47e43c9f96ce00a408dc2a42939ec9df0f6e.600x338.jpg?t=1748703546"}],"short_description":"Voice of the Ocean is a single-player adventure about a lost world, and the echoes of a forgotten past. Use your voice to sing ancient melodies and explore a world lost beneath the waves. Dive into the depths to uncover the power within your song and learn why you may be the last of your kind.","steam_appid":3367420,"support_info":{"email":"info@howest.be","url":"https://www.digitalartsandentertainment.be/page/11/Contact"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}